+task_id: R0007
+sequence: 7
+title: Define pure save migration runner
+dependencies: R0005,R0006
+requirement_ids: REQ-0006,NFR-0002,NFR-0003
+source_specifications: specification/03-technical-contract.md#persistence-migration-and-failure-semantics
+source_catalogue_ids: IMP-0007
