ief\":\"No assets; protocol is data/recovery only.\",\"acceptance_checks\":[\"fault fixtures cover write and validation failures\",\"save/cache separation\",\"GATE-0003 retained\"],\"checkpoint_cadence\":\"after metadata, after draft, before manifest acceptance\",\"recovery\":\"retain ID; wait for storage decision before accepting gated work\"},\n    {\"id\":\"R0007\",\"catalogue_id\":\"IMP-0007\",\"title\":\"Define pure save migration runner\",\"dependencies\":[\"R0005\",\"R0006\"],\"output_path\":\"projects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/runbooks/R0007.md\",\"source_specifications\":[\"specification/03-technical-contract.md#persistence-migration-and-failure-semantics\"],\"source_catalogue_ids\":[\"IMP-0007\"],\"authoring_batch\":\"B0005\",\"factory_stages\":[\"F011\",\"F012\",\"F013\"],\"asset_impact\":\"not_applicable\",\"asset_ids\":[],\"asset_brief\":\"No assets; migration fixtures retain original bytes only.\",\"acceptance_checks\":[\"predecessors migrate once\",\"failed candidate remains intact\",\"GATE-0003 retained\"],\"checkpoint_cadence\":\"after metadata, after draft, before manifest acceptance\",\"recovery\":\"retain ID and resume after R0006/gate closure\"},\n    {\"id\":\"R0008\",\"catalogue_id\":\"IMP-0008\",\"title\":\"Bound P0 identity, authorization, and connected-service exclusions\",\"dependencies\":[\"R0002\",\"R0004\"],\"output_path\":\"projects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/runbooks/R0008.md\",\"source_specifications\":[\"specification/03-technical-contract.md#trust-privacy-and-security\"],\"source_catalogue_ids\":[\"IMP-0008\"],\"authoring_batch\":\"B0003\",\"factory_stages\":[\"F011\",\"F012\",\"F013\"],\"asset_impact\":\"not_applicable\",\"asset_ids\":[],\"asset_brief\":\"No assets; a negative scope boundary.\",\"acceptance_checks\":[\"no identity/token/network fields\",\"future connected work remains gated\"],\"checkpoint_cadence\":\"after metadata, after draft, before manifest acceptance\",\"recovery\":\"retain ID and repair only this contract\"},\n    {\"id\":\"R0009\",\"catalogue_id\":\"IMP-0009\",\"title\":\"Define privacy-safe local diagnostics boundary\",\"dependencies\":[\"R0002\",\"R0003\",\"R0006\"],\"output_path\":\"projects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/runbooks/R0009.md\",\"source_specifications\":[\"specification/03-technical-contract.md#trust-privacy-and-security\",\"specification/04-experience-contract.md#empty-error-recovery-destructive-and-privacy-sensitive-states\"],\"source_catalogue_ids\":[\"IMP-0009\"],\"authoring_batch\":\"B0005\",\"factory_stages\":[\"F011\",\"F012\",\"F013\"],\"asset_impact\":\"not_applicable\",\"asset_ids\":[],\"asset_brief\":\"No assets; local redacted records only.\",\"acceptance_checks\":[\"consent and deletion controls\",\"payload redaction\",\"no network transport\",\"GATE-0005 retained\"],\"checkpoint_cadence\":\"after metadata, after draft, before manifest acceptance\",\"recovery\":\"retain ID and wait for privacy gate where required\"},\n    {\"id\":\"R0010\",\"catalogue_id\":\"IMP-0010\",\"title\":\"Establish semantic accessibility design tokens\",\"dependencies\":[\"R0001\",\"R0002\"],\"output_path\":\"projects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/runbooks/R0010.md\",\"source_specifications\":[\"specification/04-experience-contract.md#layout-visual-tokens-and-responsive-behaviour\",\"specification/04-experience-contract.md#accessibility-policy\"],\"source_catalogue_ids\":[\"IMP-0010\"],\"authoring_batch\":\"B0002\",\"factory_stages\":[\"F011\",\"F012\",\"F013\"],\"asset_impact\":\"not_applicable\",\"asset_ids\":[],\"asset_brief\":\"No final artwork, fonts, or icons; semantic tokens only and prohibit incidental assets.\",\"acceptance_checks\":[\"non-colour cues\",\"reduced motion values\",\"GATE-0002,GATE-0004 retained\"],\"checkpoint_cadence\":\"after metadata, after draft, before manifest acceptance\",\"recovery\":\"retain ID and await numeric design decisions\"},\n    {\"id\":\"R0011\",\"catalogue_id\":\"IMP-0011\",\"title\":\"Create original-content provenance control\",\"dependencies\":[\"R0005\"],\"output_path\":\"projects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/runbooks/R0011.md\",\"source_specifications\":[\"specification/01-product-brief.md#originality-boundary\",\"specification/04-experience-contract.md#experience-premise-and-originality-boundary\"],\"source_catalogue_ids\":[\"IMP-0011\"],\"authoring_batch\":\"B0005\",\"factory_stages\":[\"F011\",\"F012\",\"F013\"],\"asset_impact\":\"not_applicable\",\"asset_ids\":[],\"asset_brief\":\"No assets are created; this contract defines provenance controls for later asset-required work.\",\"acceptance_checks\":[\"missing provenance rejected\",\"human creative review recorded\"],\"checkpoint_cadence\":\"after metadata, after draft, before manifest acceptance\",\"recovery\":\"retain ID and repair only this contract\"},\n    {\"id\":\"R0012\",\"catalogue_id\":\"IMP-0012\",\"title\":\"Document foundation architecture and recovery boundaries\",\"dependencies\":[\"R0002\",\"R0004\",\"R0006\",\"R0008\"],\"output_path\":\"projects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/runbooks/R0012.md\",\"source_specifications\":[\"specification/03-technical-contract.md#architecture-and-requirement-traceability\",\"specification/03-technical-contract.md#persistence-migration-and-failure-semantics\",\"specification/03-technical-contract.md#trust-privacy-and-security\"],\"source_catalogue_ids\":[\"IMP-0012\"],\"authoring_batch\":\"B0006\",\"factory_stages\":[\"F011\",\"F012\",\"F013\"],\"asset_impact\":\"not_applicable\",\"asset_ids\":[],\"asset_brief\":\"No assets; developer-documentation closure only.\",\"acceptance_checks\":[\"all foundation ownership/dependencies/gates cross-checked\",\"does not claim release readiness\"],\"checkpoint_cadence\":\"after metadata, after draft, before manifest acceptance\",\"recovery\":\"retain ID and repair only this documentation contract\"}\n  ]\n}\nsed: projects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/runbooks/README.md: No such file or directory\n---\ntask_id: R0010\nsequence: 10\ntitle: Establish semantic accessibility design tokens\ndependencies: R0001,R0002\nrequirement_ids: REQ-0007,REQ-0010,NFR-0004,NFR-0008\nsource_specifications: specification/04-experience-contract.md#layout-visual-tokens-and-responsive-behaviour,specification/04-experience-contract.md#accessibility-policy\nsource_catalogue_ids: IMP-0010\nauthoring_batch: B0002\nfactory_stages: F011,F012,F013\nasset_impact: not_applicable\nasset_ids:\nasset_brief: No final artwork, fonts, or icons; semantic tokens only and prohibit incidental assets.\naudio_impact: not_applicable\naudio_ids:\naudio_brief:\naudio_duration_seconds: 0\naudio_loop: not_applicable\naudio_style_version:\nbrowser_impact: not_applicable\nplaywright_spec:\n---\n\n## Objective\n\nDefine original semantic tokens for typography, spacing, focus, motion, touch\ntargets, status, contrast, and non-colour cues. The contract enables later\nresponsive web UI and inherited PWA UI without selecting final visual assets or\nnumeric design decisions that remain gated.\n\n## Dependencies\n\nR0001 and R0002 are implementation dependencies. Retain GATE-0002 and\nGATE-0004 for numeric contrast, font, and breakpoint claims; neither gate\nblocks authoring this bounded token contract.\n\n## Ownership\n\n- `src/app/design/tokens/` and the semantic token inventory.\n- `docs/design-tokens.md` and `tests/app/design-tokens.*`.\n- The token consumption contract used by shared UI, web, and PWA adapters.\n\n## Behaviour\n\nUse semantic names such as surface, text, action, status, focus, spacing,\ntypography, motion, and target-size rather than screen- or asset-specific\nvalues. Require visible focus, text-plus-shape/icon status cues, and\nreduced-motion values that remove nonessential motion. Support scalable text,\nsemantic labels, and non-colour state indication without binding tokens to a\nspecific component or final visual composition.\n\n## Web and PWA differences\n\nWeb UI consumes the shared semantic contract across responsive layouts. The\ninstalled PWA inherits those tokens and accessibility behaviour; installation,\ncache, and display-mode adaptation do not introduce a separate token system.\nNo final breakpoint or browser/device compatibility claim is made.\n\n## Non-goals\n\nDo not build screens, maps, layouts, final breakpoints, final artwork, fonts,\nicons, audio, animations, or copied reference styling. Do not approve numeric\ncontrast, font, or breakpoint values while GATE-0002 and GATE-0004 remain\nunresolved.\n\n## Asset assessment\n\n`asset_impact` is `not_applicable`. This semantic contract explicitly\nprohibits incidental asset creation: no final art, fonts, icons, audio, maps,\nor other product assets may be created or reserved.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Validate representative token fixtures contain semantic labels and\n  text/non-colour cues for status.\n- Validate reduced-motion values remove nonessential transitions without\n  suppressing essential information.\n- Confirm focus, target-size, typography, spacing, and status tokens are\n  semantic and do not encode a screen or final asset.\n- Record GATE-0002 and GATE-0004 as retained before any numeric design,\n  contrast, font, or breakpoint claim.\n\n## Evidence\n\nPreserve token-validation results, representative non-colour and\nreduced-motion fixtures, and the explicit retained-gate record.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- Semantic tokens provide non-colour cues and reduced-motion values.\n- The token contract can be consumed by web and PWA UI without platform forks.\n- No final visual assets or approval-gated numeric claims are introduced.\n\nexec\n/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1,240p' projects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/runbooks/TEMPLATE.md; sed -n '1,260p' projects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/runbooks/F014.md; rg -n -C 8 'IMP-0007|IMP-0009|IMP-0011' projects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/planning/implementation-catalogue-index.json; sed -n '1,220p' projects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/runbooks/R0008.md; sed -n '1,220p' projects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/runbooks/R0006.md\" in /Users/simon/Dev/github/jakowicz/runbook-genera